# Cococoir remote-infra secrets and tofu state — never commit.
# The API token comes from the HCLOUD_TOKEN env var. WireGuard
# PRIVATE keys live here (public keys are read from here by tofu and
# rendered into remote-infra/nix/, which is checked in).
.secrets/
.terraform/
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.*
terraform.tfvars
*.tfplan
